  "FLINK-20293": {
    "jira_id": "FLINK-20293",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Done",
    "title": "Remove the useless constructor of ContinuousFileMonitoringFunction",
    "description": "In 1.11, we introduce {{ContinuousFileMonitoringFunction}} with given {{globalModificationTime}} to support {{HiveTableSource}} continuously reading non-partitioned file. While this feature has a bug, see [FLINK-20277|https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/FLINK-20277]. \r\nIn master, after [FLINK-19888|https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/FLINK-19888] finished, {{HiveTableSource}} does not depend on {{ContinuousFileMonitoringFunction}} any more, we can revert the changes of [FLINK-17435|https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/FLINK-17435] about the ContinuousFileMonitoringFunction part to avoid such bug.",
